        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333077/items/EGSGUN9U>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333077/items/EN2QZCQI>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333077/items/LGW3R6KK>,
