        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333077/items/Z3AXIGZ3> ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:GA119 ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Nature has faced multiple drivers of change from human actions. Many of these drivers have accelerated rapidly (chapter 2.1). The same is true for many changes in nature. Indeed, for some facets of nature, the changes have accelerated so rapidly that as much as half the total anthropogenic change in the whole of human history may have taken place since the mid-20th century. This section first discusses pre-1970 trends in nature before discussing trends since 1970 alongside current status." ;
    dcterms:identifier "2.2.5" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Status and trends in nature" .

